# Cloudflare Pages already serves talks.html at /talks (pretty URLs).
# Do not 200-rewrite /talks → /talks.html — that loops with Pages' .html → pretty 308.
# https://developers.cloudflare.com/pages/configuration/redirects/
#
# Tracking params (?ref=, ?utm_*): do not strip here (Pages _redirects cannot
# easily drop query strings). HTML <link rel="canonical"> already points at the
# clean URL, so GSC "Alternate page with proper canonical tag" for those URLs
# is expected — mark Done fixing; they should not be indexed separately.
#
# Do not 200-proxy absolute URLs on Cloudflare Pages (failed before). Use 301.

/favicon.ico /assets/favicon.ico 200
/oss.json /assets/oss.json 200
/talks.json /assets/talks.json 200
/projects.json /assets/projects.json 200

# Old Hugo/Docusaurus feed paths → live blog RSS
